{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "moves.adjustments",
    "description": "Template library: the multiplicative adjustments applied to a zero-hour emission factor. `exhaust_temperature_adjustment` is docs/nonroad-logging-county.md §4.2 — an EXPONENTIAL of a piecewise-selected coefficient, exp((T <= 75 ? a_cold : a_hot) * (T - 75)), NOT the quadratic an earlier draft of PLAN.md called it; it is instantiated six ways (three pollutants x two gasoline stroke counts) and the 2-stroke instantiations carry both coefficients 0, so no branch is needed to switch it off. `oxygenate_adjustment` is §4.3, with the sign kept inside the coefficient exactly as exhaust.rs:606-625 keeps it (NOx uses c = -0.115, so `1 - c*oxy` grows), which is what lets one template serve all six instantiations. `exact_else_wildcard` is the two-step lookup precedence MOVES writes over and over — the exact key first, a designated wildcard row second, and the aggregate's own additive identity third: `BaseRateCalculator`'s temperature adjustment looks a row up by the exact regClassID and then by regClassID 0 (`baseratecalculator/adjust.rs:495-520`), and reaching the second step is what makes the EV temperature factor 1.015625 rather than 1 at 59.5 °F. Both arms are separate aggregates over the same table with different key pairs, and this template is the precedence between their results — so a document that computes only the exact arm reads as obviously incomplete beside one that instantiates this. `im_blend` is the onroad inspection/maintenance blend PLAN.md §3 names; it is not exercised by the NONROAD slice but is the same shape and belongs beside the others.\n\nTHE ONROAD RUNNING-EXHAUST ADJUSTMENTS `baseratecalculator/adjust.rs` applies in order, added when `process-nox-speciation` became the first fixture to compute a criteria pollutant rather than an energy or particulate one. `gpa_blend` is the two-arm fuel-effect blend the general-fuel-ratio and criteria-ratio steps BOTH perform (adjust.rs:465, :486) -- `ratio + gpaFract x (ratioGPA - ratio)` -- and it is one template because writing it twice is how the two arms come to disagree about which is the base. In a county whose `GPAFract` is 0 it selects the normal arm, which is every county in this repository's snapshots and is exactly why the blend has to be written rather than assumed. `quadratic_temperature_adjustment` is `general_temp_adjust`'s last line (adjust.rs:142), the fall-through every pollutant with no special branch takes, centred on `exhaust_temperature_reference` so the 75 exists once. `nox_temperature_adjustment` is the NOx branch above it (adjust.rs:127-139), and its asymmetry is the point: DIESEL is `(77 - T) x A` and is switched OFF above 77 degF, every other fuel is the ordinary centred quadratic about 75 -- two different reference temperatures in one branch, which is not a thing a reader guesses. `nox_humidity_cfr86` and `nox_humidity_cfr1065` are `calculate_nox_k` (adjust.rs:168-188): the humidity correction MOVES multiplies the NOx temperature factor by, selected by a TEXT column (`noxhumidityadjust.humidityNOxEq`), linear in bounded specific humidity for CFR 86 and reciprocal in bounded water mole fraction for CFR 1065. `bounded_low_then_high` is that pair's `bound_humidity`, and it is the Go's two sequential assignments rather than a clamp: `min(max(v, lo), up)` agrees with them everywhere including `lo > up`, where both yield `up` and a three-argument clamp would panic. A fuel type with no `noxhumidityadjust` row takes no correction at all, which is the caller's `map_or(1.0, ...)` and not a template's business.\n\n`speciation_factor` is `HCSpeciationCalculator`'s NMOG/VOC multiplier (hcspeciation.rs:616-617): `speciationConstant + oxySpeciation x volToWtPercentOxy x totalOxygenate`, where `totalOxygenate` is the fuel formulation's MTBE + ETBE + TAME + ETOH volume. It is one template rather than two because NMOG and VOC take the SAME form from the SAME table under different `polProcessID`s, and written twice the two could disagree about which of the three factors the oxygenate volume multiplies. Instantiated four times by fixtures/process-airtoxics.esm -- VOC on the emission's own fuel subtype and VOC on the E10 subtype of the altTHC path, each in its value and its existence arm.",
    "authors": ["EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"],
    "tags": ["moves", "nonroad", "onroad", "adjustments", "template-library"]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "exhaust_temperature_reference": {
      "params": [],
      "body": 75.0
    },
    "exhaust_temperature_adjustment": {
      "params": ["a_cold", "a_hot", "temperature"],
      "body": {
        "op": "exp",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "<=", "args": ["temperature",
                    { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exhaust_temperature_reference", "bindings": {} }] },
                  "a_cold",
                  "a_hot"
                ]
              },
              { "op": "-", "args": ["temperature",
                { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exhaust_temperature_reference", "bindings": {} }] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "oxygenate_adjustment": {
      "params": ["coefficient", "oxygen_weight_percent"],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [1.0, { "op": "*", "args": ["coefficient", "oxygen_weight_percent"] }]
      }
    },
    "exact_else_wildcard": {
      "params": ["has_exact", "exact_value", "wildcard_value"],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          { "op": ">", "args": ["has_exact", 0.5] },
          "exact_value",
          "wildcard_value"
        ]
      }
    },
    "gpa_blend": {
      "params": ["ratio", "ratio_gpa", "gpa_fraction"],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": ["ratio",
          { "op": "*", "args": ["gpa_fraction",
            { "op": "-", "args": ["ratio_gpa", "ratio"] }] }]
      }
    },
    "bounded_low_then_high": {
      "params": ["value", "low_bound", "up_bound"],
      "body": {
        "op": "min",
        "args": [
          { "op": "max", "args": ["value", "low_bound"] },
          "up_bound"
        ]
      }
    },
    "nox_humidity_reference": {
      "params": [],
      "body": 10.71
    },
    "nox_humidity_cfr86": {
      "params": ["term_a", "bounded_specific_humidity"],
      "body": {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [1.0,
          { "op": "*", "args": ["term_a",
            { "op": "-", "args": ["bounded_specific_humidity",
              { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "nox_humidity_reference", "bindings": {} }] }] }]
      }
    },
    "nox_humidity_cfr1065": {
      "params": ["term_a", "term_b", "bounded_mole_fraction"],
      "body": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [1.0,
          { "op": "+", "args": [
            { "op": "*", "args": ["term_a", "bounded_mole_fraction"] },
            "term_b"] }]
      }
    },
    "nox_diesel_temperature_ceiling": {
      "params": [],
      "body": 77.0
    },
    "quadratic_temperature_adjustment": {
      "params": ["term_a", "term_b", "temperature"],
      "body": {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
          { "op": "-", "args": ["temperature",
            { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exhaust_temperature_reference", "bindings": {} }] },
          { "op": "+", "args": ["term_a",
            { "op": "*", "args": ["term_b",
              { "op": "-", "args": ["temperature",
                { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "exhaust_temperature_reference", "bindings": {} }] }] }] }]
      }
    },
    "nox_temperature_adjustment": {
      "params": ["term_a", "term_b", "temperature", "is_diesel"],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          { "op": ">", "args": ["is_diesel", 0.5] },
          {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              { "op": ">", "args": ["temperature",
                { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "nox_diesel_temperature_ceiling", "bindings": {} }] },
              0.0,
              { "op": "*", "args": [
                { "op": "-", "args": [
                  { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "nox_diesel_temperature_ceiling", "bindings": {} },
                  "temperature"] },
                "term_a"] }
            ]
          },
          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "quadratic_temperature_adjustment",
            "bindings": { "term_a": "term_a", "term_b": "term_b", "temperature": "temperature" } }
        ]
      }
    },
    "im_blend": {
      "params": ["rate_im", "fraction_im", "rate_base"],
      "body": {
        "op": "max",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              { "op": "*", "args": ["rate_im", "fraction_im"] },
              { "op": "*", "args": ["rate_base", { "op": "-", "args": [1.0, "fraction_im"] }] }
            ]
          },
          0.0
        ]
      }
    },
    "speciation_factor": {
      "params": ["speciation_constant", "oxy_speciation", "vol_to_wt_percent_oxy", "total_oxygenate"],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          "speciation_constant",
          { "op": "*", "args": [
            "oxy_speciation",
            { "op": "*", "args": ["vol_to_wt_percent_oxy", "total_oxygenate"] }
          ] }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
